I walk to the section where raincoats are available.
There are many types of raincoats here.
I take two coats from them.
One is a dark blue coat.
It is quite heavy.
The second one is a bright yellow coat.
It does not have much weight.
I look at both coats.
The yellow coat is better than the blue coat.
Because I sometimes ride my bicycle when going out.
In the rain, others can easily see the yellow color.
Also, this yellow coat is quite big.
Is it bigger than the blue coat?
Yes, it is much bigger than the blue coat.
My backpack is also big.
This yellow coat will cover my backpack too.
Therefore, I decide to buy this yellow raincoat.
I put that blue raincoat back.
